# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Space Engineers 2 game data — NEVER COMMIT
#
# Neither Keen's definition files nor anything extracted from them belongs in
# this repo. See Technic.md §3.4 (distribution) and §7.1 (fixtures).
#
# The ONE exception is tests/fixtures/synthetic-gamedata.json, which is
# hand-authored with invented numbers and is deliberately NOT named
# "gamedata.json" so these rules cannot swallow it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Extracted config — a build output, produced by `tc extract`
gamedata.json
**/gamedata.json
data/

# Copies of Keen's definition files used for local verification
*.def
*.vrb
**/realdata/

# ...except our own hand-written synthetic .def fixtures, which contain invented values only
# and are what the parser tests run against (Technic.md §7.1).
!tests/fixtures/def/**/*.def

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .NET
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
project.lock.json
project.assets.json
artifacts/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE / tooling
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local scratch
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
scratch/
tmp/
